# DR playbook

This playbook is for the DR team. Everyone else uses [Start here](start-here.en.md).

## The first hour

1. The crisis lead confirms the outage and opens this playbook.
2. The communications lead sends the first text message through Emaileri within 30 minutes.
3. The team meets by phone. Call :contact[crisis-lead] to join.

## Decisions to record

- When the outage started, and how it was confirmed
- Which services are affected
- Every message sent to staff or clients, with its time

:::callout{type=warning}
Never move company data to personal accounts, even to keep working.
:::

## Closing the incident

The crisis lead declares the end of the outage, and the communications lead sends the all-clear.
